<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>趣聊 - 发现更多精彩</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f0f2f5;
            color: #262626;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #3897f6;
        }

        .search-bar {
            width: 300px;
            padding: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        nav a {
            margin-left: 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #262626;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .post {
            background-color: #fff;
            margin: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
        }

        .post-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .post-avatar {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        .post-author {
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .post-time {
            font-size: 0.8em;
            color: #888;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        .post-content {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .post-image {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .post-actions {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .post-actions button {
            background-color: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: #262626;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1em;
        }

        .post-actions button:hover {
            color: #3897f6;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="logo">趣聊</div>
        <input type="text" class="search-bar" placeholder="搜索您感兴趣的人或内容">
        <nav>
            <a href="index.html">首页</a>
            <a href="profile.html">我的主页</a>
            <a href="register.html">注册</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="post">
            <div class="post-header">
                <img class="post-avatar" src="https://via.placeholder.com/40" alt="头像">
                <div class="post-author">用户A</div>
                <div class="post-time">2小时前</div>
            </div>
            <div class="post-content">
                今天天气真好，出门走走心情都变好了！
            </div>
            <img class="post-image" src="https://via.placeholder.com/600x400" alt="图片">
            <div class="post-actions">
                <button>点赞</button>
                <button>评论</button>
                <button>分享</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="post">
            <div class="post-header">
                <img class="post-avatar" src="https://via.placeholder.com/40" alt="头像">
                <div class="post-author">用户B</div>
                <div class="post-time">1天前</div>
            </div>
            <div class="post-content">
                周末在家看电影也是一种享受。推荐一部最近看的电影《XXX》。
            </div>
            <img class="post-image" src="https://via.placeholder.com/600x400" alt="图片">
            <div class="post-actions">
                <button>点赞</button>
                <button>评论</button>
                <button>分享</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2023 趣聊 - 版权所有
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
